
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about BlueGate Labs, an independent Australian software development and cybersecurity engineering initiative."
>
  <section aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h1 id="about-heading">About BlueGate Labs</h1>

    <p>
      BlueGate Labs is an independent Australian software
      development and cybersecurity engineering initiative.
      We focus on building practical applications, security
      technologies and automation solutions that address
      real-world problems.
    </p>

    <h2>Software Development</h2>

    <p>
      Our software projects focus on simplifying everyday
      tasks, improving productivity and making information
      easier to manage. Development includes Android and
      desktop applications, with an emphasis on usability,
      reliability and continuous improvement.
    </p>

    <h2>Cybersecurity Engineering</h2>

    <p>
      Our cybersecurity work explores threat detection,
      Windows security monitoring, AWS cloud security,
      reconnaissance automation and network analysis.
      Projects combine practical laboratory research
      with the development of security tools and
      automation workflows.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Approach</h2>

    <p>
      We favour practical engineering, careful testing
      and evidence-based research. Our objective is to
      create useful, maintainable technology while
      continually developing and sharing technical
      knowledge.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
